 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Access
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>` on every request. Viewers can read with
+GET. Cooks can also post to `/recipes/:id/cook`, `/batches/:id/waste`,
+`/temperatures` and `/stocktakes/:id/counts`. Managers can access every route.
+
+`GET /audit` is restricted to managers. It returns successful writes newest
+first, with a UTC `time`, `keyName`, HTTP `method`, request `path` and response `status`.
+
+Missing or invalid credentials return 401 (`unauthorized`). Insufficient
+permissions return 403 (`forbidden`).
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
