+## API access and audit
+
+Schema 3 adds `apiKeys` and `audit`. Upgraded files start with empty lists
+unless they already contain these fields. To enable access, add entries such
+as `{"key":"<secret>","name":"Kitchen","role":"cook"}` to the data file and
+restart the server. Use unique, private keys. The seed contains demo keys.
+Successful HTTP writes append an audit record in the same save.
+
